  "id": "sentient",
  "term": "sentient",
  "definition": "In this context, sentient refers to being seen as having a mind or conscious inner experience. The term is used when people consider whether an AI or robot is more than a tool and may attribute mindedness to it because of how it speaks, remembers, adapts, and acts.",
